  "caption_groups": [
    {
      "start": 0.852083,
      "end": 3.1177490000000003,
      "text": "Beavers live in freshwater ecosystems such"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.13075,
      "end": 5.5395829999999995,
      "text": "as rivers, streams, lakes and ponds."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.264083,
      "end": 9.152125,
      "text": "In Europe, beavers were reduced to"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.178166000000001,
      "end": 11.613082,
      "text": "fragmented populations with combined numbers"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.639083,
      "end": 13.175583,
      "text": "estimated across regions."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.476083000000001,
      "end": 16.989124999999998,
      "text": "The concept became popular in conservation"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.002125,
      "end": 18.408416000000003,
      "text": "and was deployed in a range of"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.434416,
      "end": 19.189624,
      "text": "contexts."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.512083,
      "end": 22.738666,
      "text": "This was mobilized to engender support for"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.764708,
      "end": 24.639708000000002,
      "text": "conservation especially where human"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.66575,
      "end": 26.644916000000002,
      "text": "activities damaged ecosystems."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.988083,
      "end": 30.514166,
      "text": "In addition, wolves often kept animals from"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.540166,
      "end": 33.131333000000005,
      "text": "grazing in riparian areas across the region."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.456083,
      "end": 36.448291,
      "text": "This protected beavers from having their"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.474333,
      "end": 38.557666000000005,
      "text": "vital food sources encroached upon by"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.583708,
      "end": 39.351958,
      "text": "herbivores."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.684082999999994,
      "end": 42.402832,
      "text": "The connectivity of streams to their"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.42887499999999,
      "end": 44.824749999999995,
      "text": "adjacent floodplain plays an important role."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.14408299999999,
      "end": 48.17533299999999,
      "text": "Stream restoration aims to improve the"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.188374999999986,
      "end": 50.50608299999999,
